  "status_text": "Two whole families of graphs, one for every size from 3 up, are now checked to need no more than 7 gates once NOT gates are allowed, however large they grow. On one-a-side inputs each has a circuit of at most 7 AND, OR and NOT gates of fan-in two at every n of 3 or more [L-meta-19380, L-meta-19382]. What they cost without NOT gates is not yet a checked row, so how much negation saves on them is not yet decided here.",
